<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>He is the Most High, God of the heavens;</l><l>He holds our breath and rules heaven’s army;</l><l>The God of gods and the Lord of kings, too—</l><l>He can overrule the king’s decree!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
